    cta: { eyebrow: "Open your store console and note the share of users affected by a crash, or simply tell us on which screens the app closes: we come back with how to connect reporting and read the first causes", title: "An ordering, delivery, booking or point-of-sale app that closes for part of your customers, or a founder in France who cannot test on the phones used in Algeria: we connect reporting, rank the causes, reproduce, fix with tests and release in stages", body: "One week to read, one to reproduce, one to fix, one to release, then a monthly table. We work from Algiers and Sétif, in French, Arabic and English." },
